{
  "uid": "newapi-traffic",
  "title": "new-api · 用户与模型流量监控",
  "description": "按用户和原始模型查看 RPM、TPM、完整生命周期并发、HTTP 状态码和协议结果",
  "tags": [
    "new-api",
    "traffic",
    "tenant",
    "model",
    "prometheus"
  ],
  "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "实例",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "newapi-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{job=\"new-api\"}, instance)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=\"new-api\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "用户 ID",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "newapi-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(new_api_generation_started_total{job=\"new-api\",instance=~\"${instance}\",tenant_id!=\"\"}, tenant_id)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(new_api_generation_started_total{job=\"new-api\",instance=~\"${instance}\",tenant_id!=\"\"}, tenant_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "模型",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "newapi-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(new_api_generation_started_total{job=\"new-api\",instance=~\"${instance}\",tenant_id=~\"${tenant}\",model!=\"\"}, model)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(new_api_generation_started_total{job=\"new-api\",instance=~\"${instance}\",tenant_id=~\"${tenant}\",model!=\"\"}, model)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "统计口径",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "newapi-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**用户 = 用户账号 ID（tenant_id）；模型 = 客户端原始请求模型名。** 可同时筛选多个用户和模型。\n\n**RPM**：最近 1 分钟请求进入速率 × 60，包含进入 relay 后的本地 429；渠道重试不重复计数。**TPM**：最近 1 分钟完成请求的输入 + 输出 token 速率 × 60，包含缓存输入和适配器估算；没有 usage 的请求无法完整统计，不用于账单对账。**并发**：完整生成生命周期内正在处理的本站请求，包含等待上游和流式输出，直到结束或取消才释放；不含管理接口。\n\n**状态码**是客户端收到的 HTTP 状态；流已提交后的失败可能仍为 HTTP 200，需同时查看协议结果。以上是观测流量，不是令牌桶剩余额度。新指标从本次升级开始；每 15 秒采样，短请求可能不会出现在并发采样点。标签超出预算归入 `__other__`。"
      }
    },
